# CSS and styling rules

This site uses the default Docusaurus classic theme and Infima. The theme font is Inter, because that is the face of the Lineth wordmark. Headings are slightly smaller than the Infima defaults. Do not reintroduce the Linea visual system: no Atyp fonts, no `--linea-*` tokens for UI, no Linea logos, and no Linea color, radius, or spacing palette.

## Where styles go

- Site-wide exceptions that the default theme does not cover belong in `src/css/custom.css`.
- A React component's styles belong in a co-located CSS module.
- Prefer Infima variables such as `--ifm-color-primary`, `--ifm-font-color-base`, `--ifm-color-emphasis-300`, and `--ifm-global-radius`.

Do not add `src/css/tokens.css`, `fonts.css`, or a Docusaurus override sheet to recreate the old Linea theme.
